//api.github.com/users/JerkinLee","html_url":"https://github.com/JerkinLee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T00:40:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T00:40:57Z","body":"As a paying annual subscriber, I also participated in the anniversary promotion. \nAfter doing so, I noticed that the GPT option disappeared.\n\nFor paid users, this kind of mechanism is extremely unreasonable and feels unfair. Taking away core features after payment—especially through promotional activities—is a very poor user experience and seriously undermines trust.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3762385013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3762471802","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2082#issuecomment-3762471802","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2082","id":3762471802,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7gQsN6","user":{"login":"JerkinLee","id":1765481,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjU0ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1765481?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee","html_url":"https://github.com/JerkinLee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JerkinLee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T01:37:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T01:37:36Z","body":"> Hello, did you use a VPN? Try closing and restarting it first.\n\nI have been a paid user of the international version of Trae for quite some time and have been using it continuously.\n\nSome time ago, a pop-up appeared at the top of the Trae browser editor, mentioning a free anniversary promotion that could be claimed. Since it was labeled as free, I claimed the promotion. However, a few days later, I noticed that the GPT option had completely disappeared from my paid annual account.\n\nI tried troubleshooting on my end, including switching networks and testing under different conditions, but the GPT option still did not reappear.\n\nTo further investigate, I logged in with a brand-new account under the same environment and the same version. Surprisingly, the new account does show the GPT option, while my paid account—especially after claiming the anniversary promotion—does not.\n\nSo under the same device, same network, and same version, the only difference is the account itself:\n\nPaid account + claimed anniversary promotion → GPT option missing\n\nBrand-new account (no promotion claimed) → GPT option available\n\nThis behavior is very confusing, and I would like to understand what caused this issue and whether the promotion affected the permissions or features of my paid account.\n\nThank you.\n\n<img width=\"880\" height=\"659\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abe21377-675c-4134-ade0-c6907a0c9658\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3762471802/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3766137774","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2082#issuecomment-3766137774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2082","id":3766137774,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7gerOu","user":{"login":"cat-kun","id":8529528,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mjk1Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8529528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun","html_url":"https://github.com/cat-kun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cat-kun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T02:36:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T02:36:41Z","body":"<img width=\"277\" height=\"452\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6454e43a-70c2-4729-9dbc-aefd558d6038\" />\n国际版有G